        "official_en_sha256": "febbda187c40777fb2c7209e2b1aa479c20832bd5c66f3253326a150564c82dd"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "さすが、ゾルダードの鉄道は\r\n警備が行き届いているなぁ。",
        "official_en": "Wouldn’t expect anything less from Zoldaad’s railway. Their security is top-notch.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "KEEP"
      },
