        "official_en_sha256": "62c34c57b71d965a275b01108d211a49722df214fb91c3895da777b9de9f215b"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "まぁ、他所の国も\r\n復興とかで大変だろうから\r\n旅行どころじゃないらしいがの。",
        "official_en": "Hm, not that other countries are holiday hotspots right now since they’re all busy rebuilding.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
