    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Town_06Zol_23:FEV_Town_06Zol_23_031:fb89d844",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_FEV_Town_06Zol_23",
        "key": "FEV_Town_06Zol_23_031",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Town_06Zol_23:FEV_Town_06Zol_23_031:fb89d844",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Town_06Zol_23:FEV_Town_06Zol_23_031:fb89d844",
        "jp_sha256": "9ae0bb072eb8821de6ace5fc2858bf8972b946226b45fff3b07263c927b72c55",
        "official_en_sha256": "eb723be323b68eede73d232dce34b9af0720121dee565d16de80f938a71969a2"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "国もまだまだ落ち着いちゃいないが\r\nそれでも大きな事件はない。\r\n本来、この国の兵士は優秀なんだ。",
        "official_en": "The country’s still reeling from the revolution, but what’s amazing is that there haven’t been any serious incidents so far. Just proves how competent the soldiers of this country actually are.",
        "real_en": "Things still haven't settled down in the country, but there haven't been any major incidents. The soldiers here really are capable."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
