        "official_en_sha256": "befd0e679396fe76e0b483b5742f0139a4eb82fd902e05140ebf232e56325b75"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "少しまえに列車で騒ぎがあったらしいが\r\n怪我人とかはいなかったみたいだね。",
        "official_en": "Heard there was some kind of kerfuffle on the train a little while back. Amazingly, none of the passengers were hurt.",
        "real_en": "I heard there was some trouble on the train a little while ago, but apparently nobody was hurt."
      },
